									<p>Established in 1966 Gundechas a property developer based in Mumbai have already developed more than 120 residential, commercial and industrial projects. The company is in existence for almost 60 years and has over 20,000 satisfied customers. The company has been steadily building Mumbai city’s skyline and lifestyle over the years. Structures, some of which have proudly become city’s landmarks as well.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f08e8ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode" data-id="f08e8ae" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="shortcode.default">
							<div class="elementor-shortcode"><script  type="javascript/blocked" data-wpmeteor-type="text/javascript" ><style>

	.elementor-form .elementor-button.is-submitting::after {
		content: '...';
		display: inline-block;
		margin-left: 10px;
	}

</style>

<script>



	document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {

		document.querySelector('#form-field-contact_number').setAttribute('maxlength', 10);

		var form = document.getElementById('form_new_gr'); // Replace 'your-form-id' with the ID of your form
		var phoneInput = form.querySelector('input[name="contact_number"]'); // Replace 'phone' with the name attribute of your phone input field

		form.addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
			event.preventDefault(); // Prevent default form submission

			// AJAX request to check if phone number exists
			jQuery.ajax({
				url: elementorFrontendConfig.ajaxurl, // AJAX URL configured by Elementor
				method: 'POST',
				data: {
					action: 'check_phone_existence', // PHP function name to execute
					phone: phoneInput.value // Phone number input value
				},
				success: function(response) {
					// If phone number doesn't exist, submit the form
					form.submit();
				},
				error: function(jqXHR, textStatus, errorThrown) {
					// Display error message
					alert(jqXHR.responseText); // Replace with your preferred method of displaying error messages
				}
			});
		});
	});


</script>

<script  type="javascript/blocked" data-wpmeteor-type="text/javascript" >

	jQuery(document).ready(function($){
		$(document).on('submit', '.elementor-form', function(e){
			var $form = $(this);
			var $button = $form.find('button[type="submit"]');

			if ($button.hasClass('is-submitting')) {
				e.preventDefault();
				return false;
			}

			$button.addClass('is-submitting').prop('disabled', true);
		});
	});


</script></div>
